<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Farm Pets YAF - 2 Accounts</Major>
    <Description>Purpose: Preventing AFK kicking while farming pets on Yeet A Friend on 2 separate accounts.

Screen Resolution: 1920 x 1080

Requirements:
~ A computer that supports multiple Desktops
~ 2 Roblox Accounts (Download one from Roblox (dot) com and the other from an appstore like Microsoft Store)
~ Enough energy on both accounts so that it doesn't stop (for energy on your second account, trade some decent pets from your main account and then throw until you have a comfortable amount of energy)

Setup:
~ Desktop 1 with one account and Desktop 2 with the other account (doesn't matter what account is on which desktop)
~ Start Autos on both accounts on the first egg (cheapest and secrets aren't based on cost; just random luck)
~ Put cursor somewhere that it won't interfere (mainly not on the "Stop Auto-Open" button or anything else) such as the middle of the screen
~ Start macro</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 10 s
KeyDown 227 1
KeyDown 224 1
KeyDown 79 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 224 1
KeyUp 227 1
KeyUp 79 1
Delay 64
LeftDown 1
Delay 64
LeftUp 1
Delay 10 s
KeyDown 227 1
KeyDown 224 1
KeyDown 80 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 224 1
KeyUp 227 1
KeyUp 80 1
Delay 64
GoWhile 1 86400000</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>